      "text": "When an urdefhan dies, its invisible flesh quickly rots away and sublimates into a foul-smelling gas that fills a 5-foot emanation around the body.\n\nThis gas deals 6d6 void damage to creatures in this area as their flesh curdles and rots as well (DC 23 basic Fortitude save save)."
